                                                "sense_id": "7d724a68-e811-3d2f-87e9-1a0d0f382503",
                                                "text": "Dolly Varden is the staple catch. To a point that, after two days, we find ourselves feeling guilty trying to shake them free from our fly or giving plenty of slack in the hope that another Dolly finds early freedom. […] Often the biggest challenge of hooking a big trout is avoiding Dollies."
